  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IORA Secondee Support 2022-25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment funds seconding DFAT officers to the Indian Ocean Rim Association (IORA) Secretariat.  IORA is the region&#x2019;s only Ministerial-level, intergovernmental organisation that delivers policies and programs to strengthen capacity and cooperation across Indian Ocean region.  Priorities include maritime safety and security, trade and investment and the Blue Economy. The secondee, as a Director of a Working Group, supports the Secretariat&#x2019;s work to advance strategic projects and foster regional collaboration.</narrative>
  </description>
